{"id":"wb-4-122","name":"南阳武侯祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"武侯祠 (南阳)","text":"南阳武侯祠，又名“诸葛亮庵”，位于河南南阳市卧龙区卧龙岗，是为纪念三国时期著名的思想家、军事家诸葛亮躬耕南阳而兴建的大型祠堂群。是中国目前尚保存的九处武侯祠之一。中华人民共和国成立以后，有众多国家领导人前来南阳武侯祠参访。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AD%A6%E4%BE%AF%E7%A5%A0_(%E5%8D%97%E9%98%B3)","revisionId":94444041,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94444041","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dd85685ae3cdc045930668cc.jpg","title":"20260904_Temple_of_Marquis_Wu,_Nanyang_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260904_Temple_of_Marquis_Wu,_Nanyang_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/20260904_Temple_of_Marquis_Wu%2C_Nanyang_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南南阳 南阳武侯祠","width":320,"height":213}}